# `agents.sessions`

All live PTY sessions (agent chats, pipeline runs, shells) — Mission Control data.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.sessions.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`SessionsListResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.sessions --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "sess-rust-lane-1",
      "kind": "agent",
      "workspace_id": "harbor",
      "agent_id": "rust-lane",
      "harness": "claude",
      "pid": 12345,
      "status": "exited",
      "log_path": ".ship/logs/sess-rust-lane-1.log",
      "spawned_at": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z",
      "last_activity": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z",
      "exit_code": 0,
      "harness_session_id": "sess-rust-lane-1"
    }
  ]
}
```
